Fan-work notice
---------------
edscene is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or connected to Hypergryph (鹰角网络), the developer of Arknights:
Endfield. Every related name, mark and artwork belongs to its own rights holder,
and this project ships none of it.

This repository ships no game assets of any kind: no audio, no images, no fonts,
no interface art. The eight broadcast events are identified by translated names
only. The program is useless until a user supplies their own sound pack and
points the app at that folder, which is why `--selftest` refuses to pass with an
empty sound directory.

Anyone asserting a right over content in this repository should open an issue;
takedown requests are honoured without argument.

